<title>FINLAND: Tamro 8-mth profit rises 26 pct.</title>
<headline>Tamro 8-mth profit rises 26 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to end-August-</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after financial items	    143 vs 114</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)	    1.15 vs 0.97</p>
<p> Net sales				   8,192 vs 6,884</p>
<p> Operating profit			    157 vs 132</p>
<p>Operating profit before depreciation  213 vs 182  Depreciation				   56 vs 51</p>
<p> Net financial items		  charge 8 vs 10 charge</p>
<p>Share of associated company</p>
<p> results				  charge 6 vs 8 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary items		    gain 1 vs 1 gain</p>
<p> Net profit				    102 vs 93</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)     43.7 vs 46.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish pharmaceutical wholesaler is Oy Tamro Ab.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0245</p>
</text>
